sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant H as useChat
    participant C as chat.get cache
    participant Send as chat.send
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as Worker
    participant Str as chat.stream reader

    U->>H: send Hi
    H->>C: cancelQueries then setQueryData(user + assistant-loading)
    H->>H: upsertConversationInList New chat
    H->>H: onFirstSend then replaceState URL (resumable now)
    H->>Send: mutate query cid turnId
    Send->>R: SET NX inflight=turnId (ok)
    Send->>R: DEL stale stream
    Send->>W: ensure convo, persist USER msg, consume credit, enqueue
    Send-->>H: accepted turnId
    H->>H: openReader then phase=streaming, ownedTurnId=turnId
    H->>Str: subscription enabled then attach (lastEventId=null)
    W->>R: xAdd delta chunks
    Str->>R: XRANGE poll 100ms
    Str-->>H: onData delta
    H->>C: appendToLastAssistant(chunk)
    W->>W: persist ASSISTANT msg, generate title
    W->>R: xAdd done + messageId
    W->>R: finalizeTurn releases lock, stream TTL 60s
    Str-->>H: onData done then terminalSeen=true
    H->>C: settleLastAssistant(messageId)
    H->>H: finishTurn invalidates list + inflightTurn, onTokensConsumed, phase=idle
    Note over H,C: chat.get NOT invalidated — the cache already holds the finished Turn
